	"name": "Welcome Card",
	"library": "shadcn",
	"category": "onboarding",
	"description": "First-run welcome card in the shadcn/ui style — a zap emblem in a tone circle over a personal greeting, supporting copy, primary CTA and a quiet skip link.",
	"tags": [
